        <item>
            <title>Version 1.2.2</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 13:17:58 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1.2.2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>Vyrux 1.2.2</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Redesigned Effects page with a compact effect list and editor.</li>
                    <li>Improved EQ response display, default values and parameter readouts.</li>
                    <li>Added double-click value editing and improved slider handling.</li>
                    <li>Fixed missing Distortion controls and Character panel updates.</li>
                    <li>Corrected effect parameter mappings and MIDI/SysEx handling.</li>
                    <li>Fixed Vocoder filter locking and status notifications.</li>
                    <li>Separated Single Volume from effect bypass controls.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
